<title>USA: Harte-Hanks Communications Inc Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>Harte-Hanks Communications Inc Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.32		    $0.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.32		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			 12,292		    9,976</p>
<p> Revs		     166,248		  146,459</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,734		   37,815</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	38,824		   37,895</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.64		    $0.77</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.63		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net			 24,515		   28,100</p>
<p> Revs		     476,775		  445,167</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,524		   36,387</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	38,613		   37,639</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 nine month net includes pretax merger costs of $12.1 million which reduced per share net $0.23.</p>
<p>1995 net includes pretax divestiture gains of $1.5 million in quarter and $13.7 million in nine months, equal to $800,000, or $0.02/shr, and $3.1 million, or $0.11/shr, after taxes.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
